NAME
  vtkSHYXExtractSelectedCellsFilter
DESCRIPTION
  "Extract selected cells; output is vtkPolyData when the selection is surface-like, otherwise vtkUnstructuredGrid."
GROUPS
  Meshing
DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
  VTK::FiltersCore
  VTK::FiltersExtraction
